This licence covers the code in this repository, and nothing else.

Unlike its sibling repo (genai-personal-lab-rag), this one has no AGPL-licensed
dependency: there is no PDF library here, because these demos take a task rather
than a document. Keep it that way -- reintroducing PyMuPDF would put the whole
application under the AGPL's obligations, including for network use.

Bundled third-party assets keep their own licences:

  - app/static/fonts/  — SIL Open Font License 1.1, see LICENSES.md there
  - samples/chinook.db — Chinook sample database, MIT
                         https://github.com/lerocha/chinook-database
